            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.17.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cik 17:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.19.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "19:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me onyo mirundi mar'adek m'abino liewo win. “Jokony ripo bedo ario kosa adek ma joridho kisi banja m'okel kwoŋ nyatoro.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndiri ca aniaŋo win kwoŋ jom'otimo reco munyo aliewo win mirundi mar'ario; to doko awaco kendo pama m'angoye bongi win ni: K'abino kendo, akibino weyo ŋat'otimo reco con kosa manyen ma k'olimo gir'acula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato wimito ŋeyo adieri ka Kristo luwo i an. Go kinyap ka tiyere gi win; kucel go nyutho meni pere i dier win. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole ogur go wi musalaba i nyapo, to gi meni pa Were go odoko kwo. Wabende wanyap i go; to gi meni pa Were wabino kwo ka watiyere gi win.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaŋasa win kwo mewin winen kafodi winitie gi yeyo. Wikuya ni Kristo Yesu nitie i win? Kono kosa timo ameno odhiero win kicutho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ageno ni wibino ŋeyo ni kikaŋasa kwo mawan k'odhiero wan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakwayo Were ni di wikitim reco, ki ma nyutho ni kono wanyalo gimoro je, to ni witim gim'otire, kada wanocale jom'opodho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato wakinyali timo gima piemo kodi adieri pa Were, rupiri watiyo ri adieri no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wasangala kada wabedo manyap tekin winitie gi meni. Am'omiyo, wakwayo nike wibende widongi i leŋo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Andiko gime munyo angoye bongi win; atimo ameno ni ka atundo bongi win akir'ater win gi mbaka, kareno aoro meni ma Rwoth omiyan madongo win, makiweno ma reyo win woko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo jowotan, kutho win! Tir win kwo mewin; winji win gim'awaco; yere win wiwegi, bedi win i siem; aka Were ma jamar kodi siem bino bedo gi win.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mothere win akor gi leŋo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ji pa Were je jodhiro riwin moth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nema pa Rwoth Yesu Kristo, mar pa Were, kodi riwirok pa Cuny Maleŋ wobedi kodi wijoje.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
